Description: Use this tool for broad external web retrieval when the agent needs current or general internet sources rather than paper-specific scholarly search. Provide `query` when possible, and optionally constrain `allowed_domains` for focused retrieval. The runtime routes through the shared provider-backed web-search API, including provider-native search and Codex CLI `--search` support.
